 "voice_claude_code_dictation": {
  "final_url": "https://code.claude.com/docs/en/voice-dictation.md",
  "last_changed": "2026-11-10",
  "last_checked": "2026-11-14",
  "last_ok": "2026-11-14",
  "last_status": 200,
  "sha": "ea589874050020cc",
  "tokens": [
   "## requirements voice dictation streams your recorded audio to anthropic's servers for transcription.",
   "* **`dictation stopped: no speech recognized for 15 seconds` or `dictation stopped at its 2-minute limit`**: in the vs code extension, a recording ends after 15",
   "* **`no audio detected from microphone`**: recording started but captured silence.",
   "* **`no speech detected`**: audio reached the transcription service but no words were recognized.",
   "* **`voice connection failed`**: your recording never reached the transcription service because the connection failed.",
   "* **`voice mode could not find a working audio recorder in wsl`**: wslg routes audio through pulseaudio rather than an alsa device, so sox needs its pulseaudio ",
   "* **`voice mode requires a claude.ai account`**: claude code couldn't find a usable claude.ai sign-in when you ran `/voice` or started recording.",
   "* **`voice mode requires a microphone, but sox could not open an audio capture device`**: sox is installed, but the host has no audio capture device, for exampl",
   "* **`voice mode requires sox for audio recording` on linux**: the native audio module could not load and no fallback is installed.",
   "a recording that captures no audio reports `no audio detected from microphone` instead of this message.",
   "audio is not processed locally.",
   "audio recording uses a built-in native module on macos, linux, and windows.",
   "hold `space` again to append another recording, or move the cursor first to insert speech elsewhere in the prompt: ``` > refactor the auth middleware to \u25ae # hol",
   "if you were speaking during those 15 seconds, try the fixes for `no speech detected`.",
   "in v2.1.229 through v2.1.231, native builds didn't show this message: claude code kept recording, the hold-mode footer still showed `listening\u2026`, and it reporte",
   "it needs all of the following: * **a claude.ai account**: the speech-to-text service is only available when you authenticate with one, and is not available when",
   "this usually means the microphone or audio stack on this host can't capture audio, for example a headless server, a remote shell with no audio passthrough, or a",
   "your speech appears in the prompt as you speak, dimmed until the transcript is finalized.",
   "your speech is transcribed live into the prompt input, so you can mix voice and typing in the same message."
  ],
  "url": "https://code.claude.com/docs/en/voice-dictation.md"
 },
