 "voice_support_voice_mode": {
  "final_url": "https://support.claude.com/en/articles/11101966-use-voice-mode",
  "last_changed": "2026-11-10",
  "last_checked": "2026-11-14",
  "last_ok": "2026-11-14",
  "last_status": 200,
  "sha": "a04aa034bf96d259",
  "tokens": [
   "claude is designed to follow natural speech patterns.",
   "dictation converts your speech to text so you can type prompts by speaking.",
   "full policy compliance: our usage policy remains fully enforced in voice mode, with all standard model misuse detection and enforcement systems actively monitor",
   "generative by design : claude is designed to generate original responses rather than reproduce text exactly or mimic specific speech patterns, which prevents im",
   "hands-free mode in hands-free mode, claude listens continuously and responds to natural pauses in your speech.",
   "note: claude fable is not currently available in voice mode.",
   "on mobile: click the settings button in the bottom left corner while chatting with claude in voice mode, then tap your preferred voice and pace: choose a model ",
